    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly sanctions screening to Google Sheets\n\nEvery Monday: your customers and suppliers screened again against the OFAC, UN, EU, UK, Canadian and Swiss sanctions lists, one verdict per name.\n\n1. **Run sanctions-screener** > Header Auth credential, `Authorization: Bearer <your Apify token>`.\n2. Change the JSON body to your own search.\n3. **Append to Google Sheet** > connect Google, paste your sheet URL.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\nNo Apify account yet? Free plan: https://console.apify.com/sign-up",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "f7b6a6d2-3d91-4651-85a0-bb5682652c32",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -340
      ]
    }
